{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "diagram_type": "architecture",
  "meta": {
    "title": "平台层收敛目标架构",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "output": "platform-consolidation-target.architecture.html",
    "quality_profile": "showcase",
    "views": [
      {
        "id": "clients",
        "label": "统一客户端入口",
        "focus": [
          "desktop-ui",
          "web-spa",
          "tui-sdk",
          "mobile-app",
          "protocol-v2",
          "host-runtime"
        ],
        "note": "四类客户端都是平等的 Protocol v2 客户端，Desktop 渲染进程也只是其中之一。"
      },
      {
        "id": "policy-exec",
        "label": "策略与执行",
        "focus": [
          "host-runtime",
          "policy-engine",
          "execution-service",
          "agent-worker"
        ],
        "note": "审批只经过 PolicyEngine，子进程只经过 ExecutionService；worker 用类型化 host/* 请求取代 __*__ 回环。"
      },
      {
        "id": "deploy",
        "label": "部署形态与薄云端",
        "focus": [
          "host-runtime",
          "host-adapter",
          "backends",
          "cloud-services"
        ],
        "note": "同一份 HostRuntime 由 Electron / Headless / Container 三种 Adapter 注入；云端只做配对、转发、推送与 OAuth 回调。"
      }
    ],
